---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="A buying guide for Call of Duty: Black Ops 6: editions, cross-play, and where to buy the digital version cheapest across Xbox, PS5, and PC."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox / PS5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Call of Duty: Black Ops 6</strong> is the 2024 entry in the long-running
      shooter series, headlined by a covert-ops campaign and the always-on
      <em>Black Ops 6</em> multiplayer and Zombies modes.
    </p>

    <h2>Cross-gen vs current-gen</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cross-gen bundle</strong> — includes both last-gen and current-gen versions (best if you haven't upgraded your console)</li>
      <li><strong>Current-gen only</strong> — cheaper, but locks you to Xbox Series X|S / PS5</li>
      <li><strong>Vault Edition</strong> — adds early unlocks and cosmetic packs; skip unless you care about the extras</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cross-play and where to buy</h2>
    <p>
      BO6 supports full cross-play, so your platform choice is about friends and
      controller comfort, not matchmaking. For the <strong>digital version</strong>,
      key stores like Green Man Gaming routinely undercut the console stores and the
      physical disc — and a digital key means no disc swapping.
    </p>

    <h2>Is the digital key worth it?</h2>
    <p>
      If you play on Xbox or PC, a GMG key activates on your account and is often
      $10–20 under MSRP a few weeks after launch. On PS5, compare against PlayStation
      Store sales and any wallet-credit discount.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=call+of+duty+black+ops+6"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Call+of+Duty+Black+Ops+6"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
